alysis as in the paper: ANOVA of perception and restoration scores across the chosen landscape types, Pearson correlations between the 11 dimensions, a structural equation model (perception -> restoration -> pro-social behaviour) and a PROCESS mediation test; the paper (264 college students, online) found 59.1% chose green space, restorative scores highest for green space (3.96) and then blue (3.79), gray (3.63) and movement space (3.56), and pro-social behaviour partially mediating the effect of landscape perception on restoration (41.5% of the total effect). Differences from the original study: (1) the paper does not say exactly how each participant's landscape type was set; its group sizes (Table 6) add up to the whole sample and its text reports which type students choose to visit, so here each participant rates the type they choose; the question wording for this choice, the visit frequency and duration options and the instruction texts are ours, because the paper does not print them; (2) the paper's questionnaire was on Wenjuanxing (Questionnaire Star) for college students in Anhui Province; here anyone can take part; (3) the age question is ours (the paper reports age groups and majors but not the questions); (4) the English item wording is the paper's Table 3 translation.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"campus\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"title\": \"How old are you?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"min\": 16,\n      \"max\": 110\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"choose\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"type_order\",\n      \"title\": \"Order of the landscape types on the photo page (set by the page)\",\n      \"isRequired\": false,\n      \"visible\": false,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"green\",\n        \"text\": \"green\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"blue\",\n        \"text\": \"blue\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"gray\",\n        \"text\": \"gray\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"movement\",\n        \"text\": \"movement\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"preferred_type\",\n      \"title\": \"Which of these four types of campus landscape do you prefer to visit?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"green\",\n        \"text\": \"Green space\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"blue\",\n        \"text\": \"Blue space\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"gray\",\n        \"text\": \"Gray space\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"movement\",\n        \"text\": \"Movement space\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"visit_frequency\",\n      \"title\": \"How often do you visit this kind of place?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"lt1\",\n        \"text\": \"Less than once a week\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"1-2\",\n        \"text\": \"1-2 times a week\